blog_image_prompt_template:
Generate a blog featured image for the following topic:

TOPIC: {{headline}}
SEGMENT: {{segment}}
EMOTIONAL CONTEXT: {{emotion}}

Image requirements:
- Dimensions: 1200x628px (landscape, blog card format)
- Must work as a Shopify blog card thumbnail
- Should emotionally connect to the reader's situation without being depressing
- Typically product-focused or lifestyle/mood
- Feel on-brand: premium, clean, warm, scientific-but-approachable

email_image_prompt_template:
Generate an email hero image for the following topic:

TOPIC: {{headline}}
SEGMENT: {{segment}}
EMAIL SUBJECT: {{subject_line}}

Image requirements:
- Dimensions: 600x400px (landscape, email hero format)
- Must be compelling at email width
- Should create visual curiosity that supports the email's teaser angle
- Can be different from the blog image — more teaser-oriented
- Feel on-brand: premium, clean, warm

regeneration_prompt_suffix:
PREVIOUS IMAGE WAS REJECTED. Generate a DIFFERENT image with:
- Different pose/angle than the previous attempt
- {{regeneration_note}}
